kidux-webapps (0.1.5) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Chromium's policy lets a child keep their work: file dialogs open,
    downloads refused only when dangerous; and it allows the hosts Scratch's
    and TurboWarp's libraries come from.
  * WebGL is drawn in software where the machine's graphics are not usable,
    so that Scratch's stage works on any computer.

 -- Antonio Morales García <info@kidux.org>  Thu, 01 Oct 2026 00:38:46 +0200

